{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An open world that can accommodate tens of thousands of people,  </strong><strong><br>with each city allowing up to 10,000 people to log in and interact simultaneously. </strong><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261390/extras/13eeddc4f3f3dc9f75c75b2aeefa61ae.avif?t=1757084354\" width=600 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shops, no top-up points; all trading currency and equipment are obtained within the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich survival skills and crafting. <br>Players can build their own homes in the post-apocalyptic world.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261390/extras/727e92a15c42a434859c536b2a75dec4.avif?t=1757084354\" width=600 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From combat and kendo to ninjutsu, from tailoring and blacksmithing to master craftsmanship, from farming and gathering to culinary expertise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 200 survival skills can be freely combined, making each character unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A metaverse that truly restores virtual characters\u2019 genitalia and sexual interaction functions to players. </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261390/extras/970694b58e69472f7d95afffbf44b6e6.avif?t=1757084354\" width=600 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can engage in various sexual interactions with each other. <br>No need to install additional mods, and no need to pay to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The screen can simultaneously display battles with 2,000 zombies and players,<br> bringing a truly thrilling and challenging post-apocalyptic world filled with thousands of zombies.  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261390/extras/3e754b0a0e80573964bbb860aaafcab6.avif?t=1757084354\" width=600 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All combat and movement-related calculations are performed server-side, <br>leaving no room for cheats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death is not the end; play as a zombie and continue to fight for the lost life, <br>evolving into the new world ruler. </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261390/extras/ba8289ded67bce850f17778be1822abf.avif?t=1757084354\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a player\u2019s character dies, they may be converted into a zombie character. <br>Although they cannot compete with well-equipped humans, they can command other zombies to launch surprise attacks using their numerical advantage. <br>With growth, they can even evolve into a new dominant species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supports full mods - <br>collect and appreciate various posters in the post-apocalyptic world, listen to music CDs, and collect cute figurine charms to decorate your character. </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261390/extras/772d6b2ec6793f5bc139f38c3ca5c57e.avif?t=1757084354\" width=600 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > These collectible items can be replaced with content desired by players using mod modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.c